{"id": "t121-001", "text": "Rohan has his knee operation on 14 November at the Royal Free. He's been told to expect six weeks on crutches and no driving, which he's not taking well because he only just started at the new firm in September. His sister is coming up to help for the first few days. Remind me to drop some food round the day after he gets home, and maybe lend him the shower stool.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rohan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee operation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "14 November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "six weeks on crutches and no driving", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not taking well", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new firm", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming up to help", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the first few days", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop some food round", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after he gets home", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "lend him the shower stool", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t121-006", "text": "Need to ring Aneesh on 22 October to see how his gallbladder op went. It's that morning, so leave it until the evening.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring Aneesh", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aneesh", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "22 October", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gallbladder op", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t121-007", "text": "Chen's mum is in hospital in Taipei with pneumonia. He's flying out on the 5th and doesn't know when he'll be back. His manager has been decent about it and given him compassionate leave, but he's worried about money because the flights were nearly a thousand pounds at short notice. He said his mum keeps telling everyone she's fine.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chen", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pneumonia", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 5th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "compassionate leave", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried about money", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t121-014", "text": "Bethany's cat Pepper had surgery on her jaw yesterday. Bethany was in bits about it. Must text her tomorrow to ask how Pepper's eating.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bethany", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Pepper", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surgery", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bethany", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in bits", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t121-016", "text": "Siobhan's gran died in the night. Funeral is in Cork, probably the following Thursday. She's going over the day before with her brother Sam.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Siobhan", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "gran", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Funeral", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "probably the following Thursday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going over", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t121-018", "text": "Long call with Magda tonight. Her partner Tobi lost his job at the warehouse at the end of September, and they've had to cancel the trip to Kraków they'd booked for 8 November. She says he's sleeping badly and won't talk about it, and she's worried about him. I should invite them both round for a quiet dinner one evening next week, nothing fancy.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Magda", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tobi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lost his job at the warehouse", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of September", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "8 November"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sleeping badly", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "invite them both round for a quiet dinner", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "one evening next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t121-019", "text": "Rana's daughter starts her chemo on 4 November. Rana is taking the first week off work to be with her.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "chemo", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "4 November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the first week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t121-020", "text": "Remind me to ask Dalia how the hen do went. It was this weekend in Bath.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Dalia how the hen do went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dalia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hen do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t121-021", "text": "Hassan had his cataract surgery on the 19th. He's not allowed to drive for a fortnight, so I'm taking him to the follow-up on 2 November.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hassan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "cataract surgery", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 19th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a fortnight"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "follow-up", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 November", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t121-022", "text": "Sofia and her husband are throwing a party for their twins' first birthday on 26 October. Bring something for the babies, ideally not plastic.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sofia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "party", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "twins", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first birthday", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "26 October", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Bring something for the babies", "owner": "r2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "babies", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t121-028", "text": "Bumped into Suzanne Morris at the station. Her husband had a minor heart attack last month and is doing cardiac rehab twice a week now. She seemed tired.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Suzanne Morris", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "minor heart attack", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing cardiac rehab twice a week", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "tired", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t121-030", "text": "Mrs Fischer next door is home from hospital after her fall. Her son is staying with her until the 10th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs Fischer", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "next door", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fall", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "staying with her", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the 10th", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t121-034", "text": "Marisol hates surprise parties. Do not let Yosef plan one for her 50th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marisol", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates surprise parties", "fact_type": "dislike", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Do not let Yosef plan one for her 50th", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yosef", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "50th", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t121-035", "text": "Nikolai has been offered a voluntary redundancy package. He has until 31 October to decide and is leaning towards taking it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nikolai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "voluntary redundancy package", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "until 31 October", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t121-036", "text": "Dinner with Caitlin. She's doing better than I expected after the breakup, and she's signed up for a half marathon in April, which is very unlike her. Her sister Bethany is coming down to stay with her for a week from 14 November, and they're planning to redecorate the flat together so it stops feeling like his. She's also back on the climbing wall on Wednesdays.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caitlin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing better", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "breakup", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "half marathon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in April", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bethany", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming down to stay with her", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week from 14 November", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "redecorate the flat", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "climbing wall", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesdays"}]}
{"id": "t121-041", "text": "Siobhan is back from Cork. She said the wake went on until two in the morning and her brother Sam gave a lovely eulogy.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Siobhan", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wake", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "until two in the morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t121-042", "text": "Anya's surgery got postponed to 9 December because of a bed shortage. She's frustrated but taking it well.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surgery", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "to 9 December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "frustrated", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "taking it well", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t121-045", "text": "Rana's mother-in-law moved in with them after her stroke. The house is quite crowded now and Rana is exhausted.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mother-in-law", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved in with them", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "stroke", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "quite crowded", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t121-051", "text": "Big dinner at Tariq's on the 2nd to celebrate the engagement. Ahmed and his fiancée will be there, plus Tariq's parents, who are coming down from Manchester the day before and staying until the Tuesday. Tariq is cooking his biryani and asked me to bring a salad. Ahmed apparently wants a proper espresso machine for the new flat, so maybe a few of us could chip in.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tariq", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 2nd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "engagement", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "fiancée", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tariq", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming down from Manchester", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none", "owner": "r2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the Tuesday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tariq", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants a proper espresso machine", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "chip in", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t121-054", "text": "Remember to call Aoife on the 8th, the day before her dad's bypass. She's going to be a wreck.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call Aoife", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aoife", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 8th", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bypass", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "going to be a wreck", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t121-056", "text": "Bethany's leaving do is on 13 November at the Fox. She got the job in Bristol and moves down the following weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bethany", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "13 November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job in Bristol", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moves down", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the following weekend", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t121-058", "text": "Laura messaged to say thanks for the flowers. She's going back to work on Monday but only part time for the first month.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laura", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going back to work", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "part time", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the first month", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t121-059", "text": "Yosef's son is having his tonsils out on 28/10. Yosef has taken the day off and the day after. Must message him that evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yosef", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "having his tonsils out", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "28/10", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yosef", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "day off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
